{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-17T08:37:30.937Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"ddb2e572b3dc24915ab9fe76","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-hw00c2","claim:pm-x07qz2","lineage:pm-x07qz2","lineage:pm-qwoy","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-hw00c2+pm-x07qz2","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-hw00c2","claim:pm-x07qz2","lineage:pm-x07qz2","lineage:pm-qwoy","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.326","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-17T08:37:30.937Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-17T08:37:30.937Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Design (branch fix/secret-guard-reference-literals-and-property-names). scanMutationSecrets now reads each object's own entries once per scan into PayloadEntry rows (name, value, path segment, name matches) shared by the leaf pass and the member pass. Every property name is judged by every rule as its own leaf (token formats, private-context rules and the key-named rules alike), memoized per distinct name per scan. A flagged name's path segment becomes the positional placeholder [key n], its index among the object's own entries, and that segment is used for the name's own finding and for every finding under it in both passes, so paths stay stable and never repeat the name. A name finding carries the new optional SecretGuardFinding field property_name: true; the dedupe key includes it, so a name and its value matching the same rule at the same path are both reported. Array indices stay positions and are never judged as names. CLI warnings still print only rule ids."}]}],"before_hash":"4fd80f7276829d77801d8cfbaa60b4508a80db01d4243ea9fb7629c03c483922","after_hash":"c85bc9835f803d04b74882866e2a578ec310cbed09f37f20b31dcaed4a3f9c11","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"27c77843bc104b4c6351b055d5e99f8ffb047962490cf3b7dd8ec83598850c8c"}
